{"id":"proprium.dominica-iii-adventus-introitus","title":"Gaudéte in Dómino semper","category":"proprium","section":"missa-catechumenorum","variant":"dominica-iii-adventus","sung":true,"st":"working-edition","ad":5,"adw":6,"about":{"pl":"Introit III Niedzieli Adwentu, od którego niedziela bierze nazwę Gaudéte. Antyfona to początek lekcji tej samej Mszy, a werset psalmu — początek antyfony na ofiarowanie: jedna Msza mówi to samo trzy razy, coraz pełniej.","en":"The introit of the Third Sunday of Advent, from which the day takes its name of Gaudéte. The antiphon is the opening of the same Mass's epistle, and the psalm verse the opening of its offertory: one Mass says the same thing three times, each time more fully."},"seg":[{"id":"s01","type":"verse","speaker":"schola","voice":"cantus","participation":{"lecta":{"gradus":4,"source":"DMS 31 d"},"cantu":{"gradus":3,"source":"DMS 25 c"}},"w":[{"i":"w001","f":"Gaudéte","l":"gaudeo","m":347},{"i":"w002","f":"in","l":"in","m":0,"h":"w003"},{"i":"w003","f":"Dómino","l":"dominus","m":29},{"i":"w004","f":"semper","l":"semper","p":":","m":32},{"i":"w005","f":"íterum","l":"iterum","m":32},{"i":"w006","f":"dico","l":"dico","p":",","m":232},{"i":"w007","f":"gaudéte","l":"gaudeo","p":".","m":347},{"i":"w008","f":"Modéstia","l":"modestia","m":24},{"i":"w009","f":"vestra","l":"vester","m":25,"h":"w008"},{"i":"w010","f":"nota","l":"notus","m":25,"h":"w008"},{"i":"w011","f":"sit","l":"sum","m":170},{"i":"w012","f":"ómnibus","l":"omnis","m":188,"h":"w013"},{"i":"w013","f":"homínibus","l":"homo","p":":","m":187},{"i":"w014","f":"Dóminus","l":"dominus","m":60},{"i":"w015","f":"enim","l":"enim","m":15},{"i":"w016","f":"prope","l":"prope","m":32},{"i":"w017","f":"est","l":"sum","p":".","m":21},{"i":"w018","f":"Nihil","l":"nihil","m":392},{"i":"w019","f":"sollíciti","l":"sollicitus","m":87,"h":"w020"},{"i":"w020","f":"sitis","l":"sum","p":":","m":393},{"i":"w021","f":"sed","l":"sed","m":15},{"i":"w022","f":"in","l":"in","m":0,"h":"w024"},{"i